eld/validate]} {:db/id "q-334285" :question/id #uuid "2d8829ca-0ab5-57ff-a0ec-1417036e9deb" :question/math-academy-id "q-334285" :question/problem "![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/differential/14074855/assets/48d8520fefe8c0d38decf417ababd94771945b802efce565a4384d4d22026409.png)\n\nThe phase portrait for a system of linear differential equations whose matrix has two complex eigenvalues $\\lambda =a\\pm b\\text{i}$ is shown above. Select the correct options in the reasoning below.The given curve is \n{{field-1}},\nrepresenting\n{{field-2}}\nthat is traversed \n{{field-3}}.\nThus, we must have \n{{field-4}}.\n\nThe spiral is traversed toward \n{{field-5}}\nas $t\\to \\infty .$\nHence, \n{{field-6}}." :question/worked-solution "Let $v=p+q\\text{i},$ where $p,q\\in {R}^{2},$ be an eigenvector corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =a+b\\text{i}.$\n\nThen, a complex solution of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t)=v{e}^{\\lambda t}.\n$$\n\nUsing Euler's formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t) & =v{e}^{(a+b\\text{i})t} \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt))(p+q\\text{i}) \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+\\text{i}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n\\text{x}(t)={c}_{1}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+{c}_{2}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q),\n$$\n\nwhere the parts $(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)$ and $(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q)$ are bounded.\n\nNow notice that the given curve is $\\text{unbounded},$ representing $\\text{a spiral}$ that is traversed $\\text{counterclockwise}.$ Thus, we must have $a\\ne 0.$\n\nAlso, notice that the spiral is traversed toward $\\text{the origin}.$\n\nHence, to insure that ${e}^{at}\\to 0,$ we require $a<0.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-334285/field-1" "q-334285/field-2" "q-334285/field-3" "q-334285/field-4" "q-334285/field-5" "q-334285/field-6"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b542bd66-f4f8-5b4e-a3e7-4717827c427a"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-334285"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-1/ae17e2311ebdcb443976f856340f688b68e78591b3ccdd9c5d8ffe3ef1675120" :answer/id #uuid "10099658-46d0-5b2a-9525-b90a1da9a419" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-1/590e223dd2b8bc7487dd03750c9d33f095cb4f45e3bb1a22990cb31f166d0d54" :answer/id #uuid "cf356728-252d-5e9b-9ca1-7f2326f11a1f" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-1/47660004af8c7eb8cb3de5f83042d3129092485a315696ee6f14551021a20f8e" :answer/id #uuid "82f7a350-5955-5d9d-a743-ee28fdc7217e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-1/0dbbee0924d29cddc95e729e19738a391c447170486ca6319bb5fb581d916120" :answer/id #uuid "aa53582d-3f0e-54cb-96c2-32ecbe1b010b" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )<0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-1/5f8e96fcef1cbe01e6835a0848fdcdb5b4ddc544a7a4da93a09510fb4372f8f7" :answer/id #uuid "dfc7128a-f588-5d14-9f01-5d4c77eae705" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )<0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-1/3eedad2b68f9e406204290c223fc7f33368e09cf74b8e7e09666a6fecaf84e6a" :answer/id #uuid "c910e0ea-997a-5729-a1ca-42b81086b64a" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "0e81c1b1-1a6e-5ccd-b435-d56edcac035d" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-334315/field-1/3eedad2b68f9e406204290c223fc7f33368e09cf74b8e7e09666a6fecaf84e6a" :answer-field/choices ["q-334315/field-1/ae17e2311ebdcb443976f856340f688b68e78591b3ccdd9c5d8ffe3ef1675120" "q-334315/field-1/590e223dd2b8bc7487dd03750c9d33f095cb4f45e3bb1a22990cb31f166d0d54" "q-334315/field-1/47660004af8c7eb8cb3de5f83042d3129092485a315696ee6f14551021a20f8e" "q-334315/field-1/0dbbee0924d29cddc95e729e19738a391c447170486ca6319bb5fb581d916120" "q-334315/field-1/5f8e96fcef1cbe01e6835a0848fdcdb5b4ddc544a7a4da93a09510fb4372f8f7" "q-334315/field-1/3eedad2b68f9e406204290c223fc7f33368e09cf74b8e7e09666a6fecaf84e6a"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-2/280edb51317f6a9c5b7147d2a4082131cdd45ac1307ffcecbd6e4226c2d1682b" :answer/id #uuid "47031009-738f-578b-927b-d7b003564c80" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "a center" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-2/0567ded365958d2b96c61c7991783dbda12d049410d79502fa82922588990c17" :answer/id #uuid "7b49b637-cf14-59df-896b-6f3f110d0116" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "a stable spiral (sink)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-2/4912676f4da8ab51f553f74fb01abf9e1196a836c79544d0c8b6e6f56bf62370" :answer/id #uuid "2fe75dee-c1ce-5148-aa23-dc54cf323083" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "an unstable spiral (source)" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315/field-2" :answer-field/id #uuid "66a4630a-bacf-59d1-9abe-6d8e6bde89a1" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-334315/field-2/280edb51317f6a9c5b7147d2a4082131cdd45ac1307ffcecbd6e4226c2d1682b" :answer-field/choices ["q-334315/field-2/280edb51317f6a9c5b7147d2a4082131cdd45ac1307ffcecbd6e4226c2d1682b" "q-334315/field-2/0567ded365958d2b96c61c7991783dbda12d049410d79502fa82922588990c17" "q-334315/field-2/4912676f4da8ab51f553f74fb01abf9e1196a836c79544d0c8b6e6f56bf62370"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-334315" :question/id #uuid "a31704fc-1a42-57e7-80da-b24092ca3cb2" :question/math-academy-id "q-334315" :question/problem "$$\n{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}(t)=-5y(t) \\\\ {y}^{′}(t)=5x(t)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the system of linear differential equations above. The eigenvalues of the system's matrix are $\\lambda =\\pm 5\\text{i}.$ Select the correct options in the reasoning below.$\\,$\nSince \n{{field-1}},\nthe equilibrium point (origin) is {{field-2}}." :question/worked-solution "Let $v=p+q\\text{i},$ where $p,q\\in {R}^{2},$ be an eigenvector corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =a+b\\text{i}.$\n\nThen, a complex solution of the system is given by\n\n$$\n{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t)=v{e}^{\\lambda t}.\n$$\n\nUsing Euler's formula, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{x}_{\\text{complex}}(t) & =v{e}^{(a+b\\text{i})t} \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)+\\text{i}\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt))(p+q\\text{i}) \\\\  & ={e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+\\text{i}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q).\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the general solution of the system is\n\n$$\n\\text{x}(t)={c}_{1}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)+{c}_{2}{e}^{at}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q),\n$$\n\nwhere the parts $(\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)p-\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)q)$ and $(\\operatorname{sin}⁡(bt)p+\\operatorname{cos}⁡(bt)q)$ are bounded.\n\nNow, notice that $a=\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0$ and ${e}^{at}={e}^{0\\cdot t}=1$ for all $t.$ Thus, we have an ellipse that curves around the origin. \n\nTherefore, since $\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0,$ the equilibrium point (origin) is $\\text{a center}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-334315/field-1" "q-334315/field-2"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9f0b176c-c802-5b3b-85d0-dede602c9bf3"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-334315"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-334318/field-1/3eedad2b68f9e406204290c223fc7f33368e09cf74b8e7e09666a6fecaf84e6a" :answer/id #uuid "af1adfed-8856-5971-9624-5dbcdbcad873" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334318/field-1/5f8e96fcef1cbe01e6835a0848fdcdb5b4ddc544a7a4da93a09510fb4372f8f7" :answer/id #uuid "7f0e614a-9da1-52a3-a3f8-e9cd1ecb892d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )<0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334318/field-1/0dbbee0924d29cddc95e729e19738a391c447170486ca6319bb5fb581d916120" :answer/id #uuid "b07e97a4-b43a-5ee4-b91c-5df234741088" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )<0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334318/field-1/590e223dd2b8bc7487dd03750c9d33f095cb4f45e3bb1a22990cb31f166d0d54" :answer/id #uuid "911eb3fb-cd1f-5798-8131-4f8c15f3bf43" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334318/field-1/47660004af8c7eb8cb3de5f83042d3129092485a315696ee6f14551021a20f8e" :answer/id #uuid "85d9a61d-c0a8-5fa7-85e9-a5aba5f072e5" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Im}(\\lambda )=0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334318/field-1/ae17e2311ebdcb443976f856340f688b68e78591b3ccdd9c5d8ffe3ef1675120" :answer/id #uuid "6af6df31-845d-5d9c-8df5-45f3be8d8174" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\text{Re}(\\lambda )>0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-334318/field-1" :answer-field/id #uuid "04e05e1b-b2f6-586c-8f6a-289ba15261eb" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "q-334318/field-1/3eedad2b68f9e406204290c223fc7f33368e09cf74b8e7e09666a6fecaf84e6a" :answer-field/choices ["q-334318/field-1/3eedad2b68f9e406204290c223fc7f33368e09cf74b8e7e09666a6fecaf84e6a" "q-334318/field-1/5f8e96fcef1cbe0